      "content": "Your kindness in worrying about others' pain is understandable, yet believing that you are solely responsible for everyone's struggles creates an impossible and dangerous burden that you cannot carry alone. Removing yourself from your loved ones will not magically erase the impact of past mistakes, but it will severely damage the relationships you cherish by abandoning everyone during their darkest hours. Please reach out to a crisis hotline or a therapist immediately so a professional can help you find a way to stay and help rather than leaving them in despair.",
      "source": "target",
